Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Usable Bundle Size", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"d073459d-127b-439c-b315-94de6963b699"],

Cell["\<\
This experiment determines the usable bundle size for given hyperparameters \
{N,P}.

Test setup:

- Prefill auto-associative memory with 200,000 items.
- For a given bundle size b, randomly select b items from the prefill data.
- Query the memory with the stochastically decimated bundle until an item \
from the bundle emerges.
- Repeat and compute the median number of queries, needed to extract the \
first item.

We define the usable bundle size as the number b for which the median number \
of query attempts is 1 or 2. 

The result depends on the decimation factor.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86cc569a-be37-4aff-8a57-73ac76739a7f"],

